    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<div>\n    <table class=\"grid dict\">\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Id: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">MEASLES.DT.04</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Url: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><a href=\"PlanDefinition-MEASLES.DT.04.html\">MEASLES.DT.04 Additional measles dose for a child living with HIV on HAART</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Version: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">0.1.0</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Title: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">MEASLES.DT.04 Additional measles dose for a child living with HIV on HAART</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Status: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">draft</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Experimental: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">true</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Type: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                    \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>system: </b> <span><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.5.0/CodeSystem-plan-definition-type.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/plan-definition-type</a></span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>code: </b> <span>eca-rule</span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Date: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">2026-11-23 11:02:25+0000</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Publisher: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">WHO</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Description: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><div><p>Whether an HIV-infected child receiving HAART needs the additional MCV dose after immune reconstitution. Hit policy FIRST. Adjudication: pending. L3 of input/decision-logic/MEASLES.DT.04.dmn.</p>\n</div></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Libraries: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><a href=\"Library-MEASLESDT04.html\">MEASLES.DT.04 Additional measles dose for a child living with HIV on HAART (logic)</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Actions: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 1: no:</b> Not HIV-infected.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 1 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 2: no:</b> Additional dose already given.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 2 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 3: no:</b> Not on HAART: no additional dose yet; an infant at high risk may get MCV0 (DT.01).\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 3 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 4: yes:</b> Immune reconstitution reached (CD4+ 20-25% or more).\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 4 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 5: no:</b> Wait for immune reconstitution (CD4+ 20-25%).\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 5 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 6: yes:</b> CD4+ not monitored: give 6-12 months after HAART started.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 6 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 7: no:</b> Due 6-12 months after HAART started.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 7 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 8: unknown:</b> Not settled: HIV status, HAART or CD4+ facts are missing.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 8 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n    </table>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
  "contained" : [{
